            <title>Smog Check: When you need one and what&#x27;s required - Bureau of Automotive Repair</title>
    <meta name="author" content="State of California" />
    <meta name="description" content='Smog Checks help keep California&#x27;s air clean and your vehicle running smoothly. Regular inspections check that your vehicle meets emissions standards. They also identify needed emissions repairs, helping you avoid costly problems later on. Find out if your vehicle needs a Smog Check and what&#x27;s required. ' />
